---
/**
 * A reference list at the foot of an article. Wrap markdown citation paragraphs
 * in this; each paragraph becomes one hanging-indented entry.
 *
 * Deliberately not a new visual register — it reuses the article serif at a
 * smaller size with muted ink, so it reads as apparatus rather than body copy.
 * Citations are migrated verbatim, including punctuation and capitalisation:
 * they are scholarly attribution, not copy to tidy.
 */
---

<div class="refs">
  <slot />
</div>
